// Built-in model catalog, embedded with @embedFile and parsed lazily by
// ModelRegistry on first use. Users override any field in `ai.models`.
//
// Seeded 2026-10-22 from the Claude API pricing page
// (https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing) and the List
// Models reference (https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/models/list).
// Prices are micro-USD per million tokens; multipliers are thousandths of
// the input price (5m write 1.25x, 1h write 2x, cache read per model).
// `cache_min_tokens` is approximate (the docs give 512-4096 by model).
// `family` keys the token estimator's calibration: claude-tok2 is the
// tokenizer introduced with Opus 4.7, claude-tok1 the earlier one.
